# Stunted Growth makes the targeted opponent choose exactly three cards and order them on their library (CR 608.2c).
[Bot1 Deck]
Stunted Growth
Black Lotus
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Forest x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island
Mountain
Swamp
Plains
Forest
Grizzly Bears
Lightning Bolt
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Green)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Stunted Growth.Cast(Bot2)
? Bot1.Mana =
Bot1.Pass
! Bot2.Choose()
! Bot2.Choose(Island; Mountain)
! Bot2.Choose(Island; Mountain; Swamp; Plains)
Bot2.Choose(Island; Mountain; Swamp)

[Expect]
Bot2.Hand.Count = 4
Bot2.Library = Swamp; Mountain; Island; Island; Island; Island; Island; Island; Island; Island; Island; Island; Island; Island; Island; Island; Island; Island; Island; Island; Island; Island; Island
